#.vscode/

# Flutter/Dart/Pub related
**/doc/api/
**/ios/Flutter/.last_build_id
.dart_tool/
.flutter-plugins
.flutter-plugins-dependencies
.pub-cache/
.pub/
/build/

# Symbolication related
app.*.symbols

# Obfuscation related
app.*.map.json

# Android Studio will place build artifacts here
/android/app/debug
/android/app/profile
/android/app/release

# Code generation (run `dart run build_runner build --delete-conflicting-outputs` after clone)
*.g.dart
*.freezed.dart

# Local secrets — API Key 严禁入库（虽然 Key 只存 secure_storage，仍防止示例/测试文件泄密）
*.env
.env.*
secrets/

# ZCode session-local plan cache
.zcode/plans/
.superpowers/
interview_vault/android/.kotlin/
interview_vault/android/build/
